  - Reddit
  - LLM annotation
  - market prediction
abstract: >-
  EconECPE is a span-level, multi-pair, typed emotion-cause pair extraction
  (ECPE) dataset built over the complete 2018-2026 r/economics archive, with
  the annotation specification, pipeline, offset-encoded labels and market
  panels used in the paper.
